{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-51-1","title":"Psalms 51:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David prays for remission of sins, whereof he makes a deep confession. 6 He prays for sanctification. 16 God delights not in sacrifice, but in sincerity. 18 He prays for the church.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2970. B.C. 1034. (Title.) when. 2Sa 12:1-13 after. 2Sa 11:2-27 O God. 25:6,7; 109:21; 119:124; Ex 34:6,7; Nu 14:18,19; Da 9:9,18 Mic 7:18; 7:19; Ro 5:20,21; Eph 1:6-8; 2:4-7 multitude. 5:7; 69:13,16; 106:7,45; Isa 63:7,15; *marg: La 3:32 tender. 40:11; 77:9; 145:9 blot. 9; Ne 4:5; Isa 43:25; 44:22; Jer 18:23; Ac 3:19; Col 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-2","title":"Psalms 51:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Wash. 7; Eze 36:25; Zec 13:1; 1Co 6:11; Heb 9:13,14; 10:21,22; 1Jo 1:7-9 Re 1:5; 7:14 cleanse. 7; 19:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-3","title":"Psalms 51:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>For I. 32:5; 38:18; Le 26:40,41; Ne 9:2; Job 33:27; Pr 28:13; Lu 15:18-21 my sin. 40:12; Isa 59:12; Jer 3:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-4","title":"Psalms 51:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Against. Ge 9:6; 20:6; 39:9; Le 5:19; 6:2-7; 2Sa 12:9,10,13,14; Jas 2:9,11 evil. Ge 38:7; 2Ki 17:17; 21:6; Lu 15:21 that thou. 50:4,6; Lu 7:29; Ro 3:4 when. Ac 17:31; Ro 2:5; Re 15:3,4; 16:5; 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-5","title":"Psalms 51:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>shapen. 58:3; Ge 5:3; 8:21; Job 14:4; 15:14-16; Joh 3:6; Ro 5:12; Eph 2:3 conceive. Heb. warm.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-6","title":"Psalms 51:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Behold. 26:2; 125:4; Ge 20:5,6; 2Ki 20:3; 1Ch 29:17; 2Ch 31:20,21; Pr 2:21 Jer 5:3; Joh 4:23,24; 2Co 1:12; Jas 4:8 inward. 5:9; 1Sa 16:7; Job 38:36; Lu 11:39; Ro 7:22 in the hidden. Job 32:8; Jer 31:33; 32:40; 1Pe 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-7","title":"Psalms 51:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Purge. Le 14:4-7,49-52; Nu 19:18-20; Heb 9:19 and. Heb 9:13,14; 1Jo 1:7; Re 1:5 whiter. Isa 1:18; Eph 5:26,27; Re 7:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-8","title":"Psalms 51:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Make. 13:5; 30:11; 119:81,82; 126:5,6; Mt 5:4 bones. 6:2,3; 38:3; Job 5:17,18; Isa 57:15-18; Ho 6:1,2; Lu 4:18 Ac 2:37-41; 16:29-34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-9","title":"Psalms 51:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Hide. Isa 38:17; Jer 16:17; Mic 7:18,19 blot. 1; Col 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-10","title":"Psalms 51:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Create. 2Co 5:17; Eph 2:10 clean. 73:1; Pr 20:9; Jer 13:27; 32:39; Eze 11:19; 18:31; 36:25-27,37 Mt 5:8; Ac 15:9; 1Pe 1:22 renew. Ro 12:2; Eph 4:22-24; Col 3:10; Tit 3:5 right. or, constant. 78:8,37; Jos 14:14; 1Ki 15:3-5; Ac 11:23; 1Co 15:58; Jas 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-11","title":"Psalms 51:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Cast. 43:2; 71:9,18; Ge 4:14; 2Ki 13:23; 17:18-23; 23:27; 2Th 1:9 take. Ge 6:3; Jud 13:25; 15:14; 16:20; 1Sa 10:10; 16:14; 2Sa 7:15 Isa 63:10,11 holy. Lu 11:13; Joh 14:26; Ro 1:4; 8:9; Eph 4:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-12","title":"Psalms 51:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Restore. 85:6-8; Job 29:2,3; Isa 57:17,18; Jer 31:9-14 joy. 13:5; 21:1; 35:9; Isa 49:13; 61:10; Lu 1:47; Ro 5:2-11 uphold. 17:5; 19:13; 119:116,117,133; Isa 41:10; Jer 10:23; Ro 14:4 1Pe 1:5; Jude 1:24 free. Ro 8:15; 2Co 3:17; Ga 4:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-13","title":"Psalms 51:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Then. 32:5,8-10; Zec 3:1-8; Lu 22:32; Joh 21:15-17; Ac 2:38-41; 9:19-22 2Co 5:8-20 ways. 25:4,8; Isa 2:3; Ac 13:10 converted. 19:7; Isa 6:10; Jer 31:18; Mt 18:3; Ac 3:19; 15:3; 26:18-20 Jas 5:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-14","title":"Psalms 51:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Deliver. 26:9; 55:23; Ge 9:6; 42:22; 2Sa 3:28; 11:15-17; 12:9; 21:1 bloodguiltiness. Heb. bloods. Eze 33:8; Ho 4:2; Ac 18:6; 20:26 thou God. 38:22; 68:20; 88:1; Isa 12:2; 45:17; Hab 3:18 tongue. 35:28; 71:15-24; 86:12,13 righteousness. Ezr 9:13; Ne 9:33; Da 9:7,16; Ro 10:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-15","title":"Psalms 51:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>O Lord. Ge 44:16; 1Sa 2:9; Eze 16:63; Mt 22:12; Ro 3:19 open. Ex 4:11; Eze 3:27; 29:21; Mr 7:34 mouth. 63:3-5; 119:13; Heb 13:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-16","title":"Psalms 51:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>desirest. 6; Ex 21:14; Nu 15:27,30,31; 35:31; De 22:22; Ho 6:6 else would I. or, that I should. delightest. 40:6; 50:8; Pr 15:8; 21:27; Isa 1:11-15; Jer 7:22,23,27; Am 5:21-23 Heb 10:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-17","title":"Psalms 51:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>sacrifices. 107:22; Mr 12:33; Ro 12:1; Php 4:18; Heb 13:16; 1Pe 2:5 a broken spirit. 34:18; 147:3; 2Ki 22:19; Isa 57:15; 61:1-3; 66:2; Eze 9:3,4,6 Mt 5:3; Lu 18:11-14 thou. 22:24; 102:17; 2Ch 33:12,13; Am 5:21; Lu 7:39-50; 15:2-7,10,21-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-18","title":"Psalms 51:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Do. 25:22; 102:16; 122:6-9; 137:5,6; Isa 62:1,6,7; Jer 51:50 2Co 11:28,29 thy. Lu 12:32; Eph 1:5,9; Php 2:13; 2Th 1:11 build. Ne 2:17; Isa 58:12; Da 9:25; Mic 7:11; Zec 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-51-19","title":"Psalms 51:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":51,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":51,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>pleased. 66:13-15; 118:27; Eph 5:2 sacrifices. 4:5; Mal 3:3; Ro 12:1</p>"}]}